{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-marco-paul-electric-hot-water-bottle-2608-0088","content_id":"efd57d86-3eee-495a-82fb-b147d6fecd7a","description":"Product Safety Report for Marco Paul Electric Hot Water Bottle presenting a serious risk of electric shock. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"f7bad22b-3fd8-4e2b-b3cf-868d6dd2b522","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:37:17+01:00","id":"f7bad22b-3fd8-4e2b-b3cf-868d6dd2b522","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-17T14:37:17+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a830e8d92ec93e1e0329a93/2608-0088-product-safety-report-marco-paul-electric-hot-water-bottle.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Marco Paul Electric Hot Water Bottle</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of electric shock because the external build quality is poor, and the user may access live parts.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Personal Warming/Massaging (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Marco Paul</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Item Number (on box)</td>\n      <td>MP24</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model (on label)</td>\n      <td>HK-380</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5056713212730</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Pingyang County Huaiken Electric Appliance Factory</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Grey plush hand-warmer with separate plug-in adaptor.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_f7bad22b-3fd8-4e2b-b3cf-868d6dd2b522\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a830e8d92ec93e1e0329a93/2608-0088-product-safety-report-marco-paul-electric-hot-water-bottle.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of electric shock because the external build quality is poor, and the user may access live parts. The product also has poor quality connections to the microswitch, with crimps not capturing the entire conductor, presenting a risk of fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2608-0088</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-17T13:41:03Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-17","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-17T14:41:03+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-marco-paul-electric-ho